{"seq":3,"slug":"k-anonymity-and-beyond","title":"k-匿名与 l-多样性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/data-privacy-engineering/deidentification-and-pets/k-anonymity-and-beyond","wordCount":2425,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"k-匿名与-l-多样性\">k-匿名与 l-多样性</h1><p>1998 年 Latanya Sweeney 做过一个让监管者坐立不安的实验：仅凭「邮编 + 出生日期 + 性别」三个字段，就能在公开人口数据里唯一定位约 87% 的美国人（<a href=\"https://www.researchgate.net/publication/267716853_Simple_Demographics_Often_Identify_People_Uniquely\">Sweeney, <em>Simple Demographics Often Identify People Uniquely</em></a>）。这些字段单独看都不是身份证号那样的直接标识符，可一旦组合起来再去和选民登记册这类外部表做链接，就能反推出某条「匿名」医疗记录到底属于谁。k-匿名正是为堵住这种「链接攻击」而生的：它把单字段脱敏的视角，升级为对「字段组合」的群体不可区分性约束。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>k-匿名的关键术语只有三个，必须先分清，否则后面的攻击与改进都无从谈起。<strong>直接标识符</strong>（姓名、身份证、手机号）发布前直接删除或哈希。**准标识符（quasi-identifier，QI）**是邮编、年龄、性别这类「自己不唯一、组合起来可链接外部数据」的字段，是 k-匿名真正处理的对象。<strong>敏感属性</strong>是数据使用方真正想分析、却不愿被对号入座到个人的字段，比如「确诊病种」「薪资」。</p>\n<p>k-匿名的定义朴素：对准标识符做泛化（generalization，如把「1987-03-12」泛化为「1980s」）和抑制（suppression，删格或整行）后，发布表里任意一行在准标识符上，都至少和另外 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 行完全相同（<a href=\"https://satoricyber.com/data-masking/how-k-anonymity-preserves-data-privacy/\">Sweeney 1998 / Satori</a>）。这些在 QI 上无法相互区分的行构成一个<strong>等价类（equivalence class）</strong>，类的大小记为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|E|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span>。满足 k-匿名等价于：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>E</mi></munder><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>≥</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\min_{E} |E| \\ge k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.4943em;vertical-align:-0.7443em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">min</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7443em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>直觉上，攻击者拿着外部数据来链接，最好的结果也只能把目标缩小到一个大小 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ge k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 的群体，单条记录被指认的概率被压到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\le 1/k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[原始表&lt;br/&gt;直接标识符+QI+敏感属性] --&gt; B[删除直接标识符]&#10;  B --&gt; C[对 QI 做泛化/抑制]&#10;  C --&gt; D{每个等价类&lt;br/&gt;大小 &gt;= k ?}&#10;  D --&gt;|否| C&#10;  D --&gt;|是| E[k-匿名表&lt;br/&gt;身份不可区分]&#10;  E --&gt; F{同一类内敏感值&lt;br/&gt;是否多样 ?}&#10;  F --&gt;|否, 同质| G[l-多样性: 要求每类 &gt;= l 个不同敏感值]&#10;  F --&gt;|是| H[可发布]&#10;  G --&gt; H\">flowchart TD\n  A[原始表&lt;br/&gt;直接标识符+QI+敏感属性] --&gt; B[删除直接标识符]\n  B --&gt; C[对 QI 做泛化/抑制]\n  C --&gt; D{每个等价类&lt;br/&gt;大小 &gt;= k ?}\n  D --&gt;|否| C\n  D --&gt;|是| E[k-匿名表&lt;br/&gt;身份不可区分]\n  E --&gt; F{同一类内敏感值&lt;br/&gt;是否多样 ?}\n  F --&gt;|否, 同质| G[l-多样性: 要求每类 &gt;= l 个不同敏感值]\n  F --&gt;|是| H[可发布]\n  G --&gt; H</pre><p>下表对比三代主流模型的防护目标与已知短板，这是本文的主线：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模型</th>\n<th>约束对象</th>\n<th>防住什么</th>\n<th>防不住什么</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>k-匿名</td>\n<td>等价类大小 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ge k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>身份披露（链接攻击）</td>\n<td>同质攻击、背景知识攻击（属性披露）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>l-多样性</td>\n<td>每类 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ge l</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span> 个「良好表示」的敏感值</td>\n<td>同质攻击</td>\n<td>偏斜攻击、相似性攻击</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>t-接近性</td>\n<td>类内敏感值分布与全表分布距离 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\le t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>相似性/分布攻击</td>\n<td>效用骤降、跨表组合仍有残险</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"k-匿名拦不住的两类攻击\">k-匿名拦不住的两类攻击</h2><p>k 值再大，也只保证「你猜不出是谁」，并不保证「你猜不出他得了什么病」——这正是 k-匿名最根本的盲区：它防身份披露（identity disclosure），不防<strong>属性披露（attribute disclosure）</strong>。两类经典攻击把这个洞撕得很大（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2510.11299\">NIST/arXiv 综述</a>）。</p>\n<p><strong>同质攻击（homogeneity attack）</strong>：假设某等价类有 4 行（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k=4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span> 看着很安全），但这 4 个人的「确诊」字段全是「胃癌」。攻击者只要知道目标的邮编和年龄落在这个类，无需区分具体是哪一行，就 100% 确定他患胃癌——身份没被识别，敏感信息却完全泄露。</p>\n<p><strong>背景知识攻击（background-knowledge attack）</strong>：等价类里敏感值是「心脏病」和「流感」各两条，看似有多样性。但攻击者若额外知道「目标是常年跑马拉松的运动员」，就能排除心脏病，把答案锁定到流感。外部背景知识把多样性「过滤」掉了。</p>\n<p>这两点说明：单看等价类大小是不够的，必须对<strong>类内敏感值的分布</strong>也加约束。</p>\n<h2 id=\"l-多样性-给每个等价类强制-敏感值多样\">l-多样性：给每个等价类强制「敏感值多样」</h2><p>Machanavajjhala 等人提出 l-多样性，直接针对同质攻击：要求每个等价类里至少有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>l</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">l</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span> 个「良好表示（well-represented）」的不同敏感值（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/L-diversity\">Wikipedia: l-diversity</a>）。最简单的「可区分 l-多样性」就是数 distinct 值：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∀</mi><mi>E</mi><mo>:</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>s</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>E</mi><mtext> </mtext><msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mtext>distinct</mtext></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>≥</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\forall E:\\ |\\{\\,s : s \\in E\\,\\}_{\\text{distinct}}| \\ge l</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∀</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">}</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">distinct</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>更严格的变体用熵来度量分布是否真的分散，要求等价类内敏感属性的香农熵不低于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\log l</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>s</mi></munder><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≥</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-\\sum_{s} p(s\\mid E)\\,\\log p(s\\mid E) \\ge \\log l</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.9em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.25em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>熵 l-多样性比「数 distinct」更难被钻空子：哪怕有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>l</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">l</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span> 个不同值，只要其中一个占了 95%，熵也会很低、不达标，从而堵住「名义多样、实则一边倒」的情况。</p>\n<p>但 l-多样性远非终点，它「既不必要也不充分」（<a href=\"https://utrechtuniversity.github.io/dataprivacyhandbook/k-l-t-anonymity.html\">Utrecht Data Privacy Handbook</a>）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>偏斜攻击（skewness attack）</strong>：若某病在总人群中患病率只有 1%，而某等价类里达到 50%，即便满足 l-多样性，攻击者对类内个体的患病信念也从 1% 暴涨到 50%——相对全局先验，信息泄露巨大。</li>\n<li><strong>相似性攻击（similarity attack）</strong>：等价类的敏感值是「胃溃疡、胃炎、胃癌」，distinct 数达标，但它们语义上都属于「胃部疾病」，攻击者照样得知目标有胃病。l-多样性只看「值是否不同」，不看「值在语义上是否接近」。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"t-接近性与向差分隐私的让渡\">t-接近性与向差分隐私的让渡</h2><p>为补上偏斜与相似性攻击，Li 等人提出 t-接近性：要求每个等价类内敏感属性的分布，与它在<strong>全表</strong>上的分布之间的距离不超过阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>（<a href=\"https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/document/4221659/\">t-Closeness, IEEE</a>）。距离常用 EMD（推土机距离，Earth Mover&#39;s Distance），因为它能体现敏感值之间的语义远近：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∀</mi><mi>E</mi><mo>:</mo><mtext> </mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></mrow><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo><mo>≤</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\forall E:\\ \\mathrm{EMD}\\big(P(S\\mid E),\\ P(S)\\big) \\le t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∀</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">EMD</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>直觉是：如果每个小群体的疾病分布都和「整体人群分布」差不多，那么知道某人落在哪个群体，对推断他的病情几乎没有额外帮助——偏斜被压平，语义相近的值也因 EMD 的搬运代价被算进距离。</p>\n<p>2025 年的一项实证分析量化了这条「QI-脱敏家族」的效用代价：t-接近性在抗攻击性上最强，但代价是信息粒度大幅下降（泛化更狠、可分析性更差）；k-匿名抗攻击性最弱，却保留了最好的实际效用（<a href=\"https://science.lpnu.ua/csn/all-volumes-and-issues/volume-7-number-1-2025/analysis-of-effectiveness-and-vulnerabilities-of-privacy-preserving-methods-using-k-anonymity-l-diversity-and-t-closeness-as-examples\">LPNU CSN, 2025</a>）。这是整个 QI 范式绕不开的「隐私-效用」权衡。</p>\n<p>更深的结构性质疑来自真实世界的去匿名事件——Netflix 评分数据集和 AOL 搜索日志都曾被研究者重新识别，由此引发对「准标识符 vs 普通属性」这条划线本身是否站得住脚的政策辩论（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2202.13470\"><em>Attacks on Deidentification&#39;s Defenses</em>, arXiv</a>）。当攻击者掌握的辅助信息足够多时，任何字段都可能变成准标识符，k-匿名家族赖以成立的前提就动摇了。</p>\n<p>正因如此，2025 年 3 月 NIST 正式发布 <strong>SP 800-226《差分隐私保障评估指南》</strong>，把差分隐私（DP）确立为「以数学方式严格量化隐私损失」的评估基准（<a href=\"https://www.nist.gov/news-events/news/2025/03/nist-finalizes-guidelines-evaluating-differential-privacy-guarantees-de\">NIST, 2025-03</a>）。和 k-匿名「靠假设攻击者背景知识有限」不同，DP 给出的是对任意背景知识都成立的最坏情况保证。两者并非互斥：研究表明，在发布前做随机抽样、再以安全方式做 k-匿名化，可满足差分隐私性质（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/1101.2604\"><em>On Sampling, Anonymization, and Differential Privacy</em></a>），这给「先泛化、后加噪」的混合管线提供了理论依据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"工程落地的取舍\">工程落地的取舍</h2><p>把上述模型搬进生产管线时，下面几条经验比公式更影响成败。</p>\n<p><strong>准标识符的认定是工程难点，不是数学难点。</strong> 哪些字段算 QI 取决于攻击者能拿到什么外部数据，而这随时间变化。务实做法是按「形状/来源」而非固定清单来判定：凡是「在外部公开数据中可链接、且区分度高」的字段都按 QI 处理，并定期重审，因为今天的普通属性可能因新数据集出现而变成明天的 QI。</p>\n<p><strong>k、l、t 不是越大越好。</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 越大、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>l</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">l</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span> 越多、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 越小，泛化就越狠，等价类越粗，分析价值越低。监管常见起点是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k \\ge 5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8304em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span>（医疗/统计披露），但最终值要结合数据效用目标和重识别风险评估来定，而非拍脑袋。</p>\n<p><strong>优先用成熟库而非手写泛化算法。</strong> 主流实现（如 ARX、Mondrian 类算法及其规模化变体）已处理好泛化层级、抑制率控制、最优化搜索等细节；2025 年还出现了面向大数据集的可扩展 k-匿名方案 SKALD（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2505.03529\">SKALD, arXiv 2505.03529</a>）。自己实现极易在「最优泛化是 NP-难」这类问题上踩坑。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[识别字段类型] --&gt; B[直接标识符: 删除]&#10;  A --&gt; C[准标识符: 定义泛化层级]&#10;  A --&gt; D[敏感属性: 选多样性度量]&#10;  C --&gt; E[运行 k-匿名/l-多样性算法]&#10;  D --&gt; E&#10;  E --&gt; F[做重识别风险评估]&#10;  F --&gt; G{风险可接受 ?}&#10;  G --&gt;|否| H[提高 k/l 或叠加差分隐私]&#10;  G --&gt;|是| I[发布 + 留存方法学审计记录]&#10;  H --&gt; E\">flowchart TD\n  A[识别字段类型] --&gt; B[直接标识符: 删除]\n  A --&gt; C[准标识符: 定义泛化层级]\n  A --&gt; D[敏感属性: 选多样性度量]\n  C --&gt; E[运行 k-匿名/l-多样性算法]\n  D --&gt; E\n  E --&gt; F[做重识别风险评估]\n  F --&gt; G{风险可接受 ?}\n  G --&gt;|否| H[提高 k/l 或叠加差分隐私]\n  G --&gt;|是| I[发布 + 留存方法学审计记录]\n  H --&gt; E</pre><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>k-匿名通过对准标识符泛化/抑制，使每个等价类大小 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ge k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>，把单条记录被链接识别的概率压到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\le 1/k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>，防的是<strong>身份披露</strong>。</li>\n<li>它防不住<strong>属性披露</strong>：同质攻击（类内敏感值全相同）和背景知识攻击各撕开一道口子。</li>\n<li>l-多样性要求每个等价类有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ge l</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span> 个良好表示的敏感值（含更严格的熵版本），堵住同质攻击，但对偏斜攻击和相似性攻击「既不必要也不充分」。</li>\n<li>t-接近性进一步要求类内分布接近全表分布（常用 EMD），抗攻击最强但效用代价最大——整个 QI 家族都困在隐私-效用权衡里。</li>\n<li>Netflix/AOL 等真实去匿名事件动摇了「QI 划线」前提；NIST SP 800-226（2025-03）把差分隐私确立为对任意背景知识都成立的评估基准，混合「k-匿名 + 抽样/加噪」是当前的实务方向。</li>\n<li>工程上：QI 按「可链接 + 高区分度」的形状动态判定、参数结合风险评估而非越大越好、优先复用成熟库并留存方法学审计记录。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"k-匿名与 l-多样性","id":"k-匿名与-l-多样性"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"k-匿名拦不住的两类攻击","id":"k-匿名拦不住的两类攻击"},{"level":2,"text":"l-多样性：给每个等价类强制「敏感值多样」","id":"l-多样性-给每个等价类强制-敏感值多样"},{"level":2,"text":"t-接近性与向差分隐私的让渡","id":"t-接近性与向差分隐私的让渡"},{"level":2,"text":"工程落地的取舍","id":"工程落地的取舍"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"差分隐私","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/data-privacy-engineering/deidentification-and-pets/differential-privacy"},"next":{"title":"同态加密","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/data-privacy-engineering/privacy-preserving-computation/homomorphic-encryption"}}